  "description": "<p>This inspirational faith floral area carpet offers a unique blend of comfort and spiritual decor. Designed with a traditional style, this rug features a non-skid backing for enhanced safety and durability. It serves as a versatile floor mat, suitable for various settings while adding a meaningful touch to any room.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features an inspirational faith floral design</li>\n<li>Can be personalized with a name or text</li>\n<li>Soft polyester fabric for comfort</li>\n<li>Anti-slip backing ensures safety</li>\n<li>Versatile for home and church use</li>\n<li>Wrinkle-resistant and fade-resistant for lasting beauty</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Bedroom, Living Room, Office, Gamer Room, Reading Nook, Church</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Floral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Faith, Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Traditional</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum for quick cleaning or machine wash for deeper care</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Vacuum, Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile area rug is ideal for enhancing the ambiance of entryways, bedrooms, living rooms, offices, gamer rooms, and cozy reading nooks. It is also well-suited for use in meditation corners or as a decorative piece in churches, blending spiritual and interior atmospheres.</p>",
